In Pokémon Inritum, you will be able to find regional variants that are unique to Hessia.

This can also include new evolutions never seen before, or even completely new mega evolutions!

Below, you can find a list of all the Hessian variants in the game so far:

* Ponyta
* Rapidash
* Hoothoot
* Noctowl
* Blutowl (new evolution)
* Beldum
* Metang
* Metagross
* Aron
* Lairon
* Aggron
* Poochyena
* Mightyena
* Litwick
* Lampent
* Chandelure
